# --- Personal financial data: NEVER in this repository -----------------------
# This repo is cloud-session-enabled and may become a GitHub remote. The owner's
# financial records live in C:\Users\valer\Investing and must never arrive here,
# not even as a stray copy. These are basename patterns, so they match at any depth.
# Enforcement is NOT this file alone: see tests/test_no_personal_data.py and
# tools/pre-commit, because .gitignore does not stop `git add -f` or a file that
# is already tracked.
trade-journal.csv
holdings.json
funding-log.csv
tax-record.csv
ledger_*.csv
nbu_rates.csv
flex-*.xml
*flex*.xml
secrets.env
.env

# --- Bulk data: too large to commit, and re-derivable ------------------------
# A 15-year daily panel for ~8,000 names is 0.5-0.7 GB in parquet. GitHub rejects
# files over 100 MiB and LFS free bandwidth (~10 GiB/month) is exhausted by ~20
# clones. Raw data is downloaded, never committed; only small derived artefacts
# (year-partitioned monthly factor panels, 5-13 MB) may be committed deliberately.
data/
*.parquet
*.zip
*.gz

# --- Environment -------------------------------------------------------------
# The venv lives OUTSIDE OneDrive at C:\Users\valer\.venvs\market-monitor so that
# thousands of site-packages files are not sync-churned. If one is ever created
# here by accident, it stays untracked.
.venv/
venv/
__pycache__/
*.pyc
.pytest_cache/
.ruff_cache/

# --- Editor / OS -------------------------------------------------------------
.idea/
.vscode/
Thumbs.db
desktop.ini

